# GENERATED by build/make_baseview_icons.py - do not hand-edit.
#
# Base-view facility sprites, one frame per base square. Frame order is BaseView's
# own: left to right, then top to bottom, so a 2x2 is NW, NE, SW, SE.
#
# These are spriteFacility frames only. They are drawn ON TOP of a spriteShape, which
# still comes from vanilla (1 = plain square), and they are inset so that plate's
# bevel shows as a rim - art opaque to the edge makes the whole base one grey field.
#
# Indices start at 100 because vanilla BASEBITS ends at 53.
